  "contract": [
    "Prepare local and remote documents in existing ready renderer sessions with unique execution-context identities. Admit original-context destruction watches before document mutation; their shared per-page allowance remains 128.",
    "Retain each restoration object, original renderer lease and native context-destruction signal. Restore and release only in the original session. Do not create temporary screenshot attachments or detach shared sessions as screenshot cleanup.",
    "Keep dispatched preparation and restoration commands, page/browser ownership and bounded cleanup admission through late native reply settlement. Unconfirmed preparation/restoration triggers bounded affected-page retirement; a confirmed destroyed child can preserve its parent.",
    "Keep original operation deadlines, page serialization, main-document font waiting, root screenshot capture and existing pixel/byte limits. No native screenshot startup retry, new rendering delay or graphics flag is adopted."
  ],
